# ######################################################################
# SkyRunner Analytics - Root .gitignore (Monorepo)
# ######################################################################

# Dependências (Ignora node_modules em qualquer subpasta)
**/node_modules/

# Arquivos de Build e Produção
**/dist/
**/build/
**/out/
**/.next/
*.zip

# Arquivos de Configuração Local e Variáveis de Ambiente (CRÍTICO)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local

# Logs de Erros e Execução
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Arquivos do Sistema Operacional
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# Configurações Locais de IDEs (Opcional, mas recomendado para duplas)
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.swp

# Claude Code
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/